# ============================================================
# New_Game — repository root ignore rules
# Maintained by Toolchain Engineer. Git tracks config/source,
# never runtime caches or downloaded binary tool artifacts.
# docs/ is intentionally NOT ignored: governance & evidence must
# be version controlled.
# ============================================================

# ---- Godot 4.x editor/runtime caches (regenerate on open/save) ----
.godot/
.godot/*

# ---- gdmcp toolchain: keep the .gdmcp directory (future project
#      checkpoints/config), but never commit the downloaded CLI
#      binary. gdmcp.exe is a ~4.7 MB compiled artifact fetched at
#      tool setup; a toolchain repo versions config, not binaries. ---
godot_game_dev/.gdmcp/bin/
.gdmcp/bin/

# ---- Godot platform/export output ----
/android/
/ios/
/web/
/export/
*/build/
# export_presets.cfg IS tracked (P6 authorized export config); only build output stays out
!godot_game_dev/export_presets.cfg

# ---- Godot translation/import caches (safe to regenerate) ----
*.tmp
*.translation.bin

# ---- Temporary & editor/OS junk ----
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.fseventsd/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# ---- Logs / coverage output if any tooling produces them ----
logs/
coverage/
*.cache

# ---- DSH / skill harness internal tooling state (not project
#      deliverables; regenerable transient artifacts) ----
.dsh-vision-router/
.skill-evals/

# ---- Phase A repo hygiene (2026-08-20): archived stray MCP
#      request/response JSON + untracked staging dirs (content
#      preserved on disk, kept out of version control) ----
_archive/
_phase4_vfx_stage/
dsh_gdmcp_staging/

# ---- Tooling & Evidence Engineer (2026-08-21) ----
# Ad-hoc runner/capture logs and legacy free-form screenshots are transient.
# Formal evidence lives under qa/evidence/<evidence-id>/ and is indexed before commit.
godot_game_dev/qa/*.log
godot_game_dev/qa/*.err
godot_game_dev/qa/*.out
godot_game_dev/qa/screenshots/
!godot_game_dev/qa/screenshots/b2_pierce_verification.jpg
!godot_game_dev/qa/evidence/
!godot_game_dev/qa/evidence/**
